    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"#setServlet(T)\"><code>servlet</code></a> must be specified before calling\n<a href=\"RegistrationBean.html#onStartup(jakarta.servlet.ServletContext)\"><code>RegistrationBean.onStartup(ServletContext)</code></a>. URL mapping can be configured used <a href=\"#setUrlMappings(java.util.Collection)\"><code>setUrlMappings(Collection)</code></a> or\nomitted when mapping to '/*' (unless\n<a href=\"#%3Cinit%3E(T,boolean,java.lang.String...)\"><code>alwaysMapUrl</code></a> is set to\n<code>false</code>). The servlet name will be deduced if not specified.",
      "translation": "在调用 <a href=\"RegistrationBean.html#onStartup(jakarta.servlet.ServletContext)\"><code>RegistrationBean.onStartup(ServletContext)</code></a> 之前，必须指定 <a href=\"#setServlet(T)\"><code>servlet</code></a>。URL 映射可以通过使用 <a href=\"#setUrlMappings(java.util.Collection)\"><code>setUrlMappings(Collection)</code></a> 进行配置，或者在映射到 '/*' 时省略（除非将 <a href=\"#%3Cinit%3E(T,boolean,java.lang.String...)\"><code>alwaysMapUrl</code></a> 设置为 <code>false</code>）。如果未指定 servlet 名称，则会自动推导。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
